                                               rdfs:label "pulsed probe-based techniques" .


###  http://purl.org/pan-science/PaNET/PaNET00106
<http://purl.org/pan-science/PaNET/PaNET00106> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                               owl:equivalentClass [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                     owl:onProperty <http://purl.org/pan-science/PaNET/PaNET1005000> ;
