                                               rdfs:label "microfocused probe-based techniques" .


###  http://purl.org/pan-science/PaNET/PaNET00107
<http://purl.org/pan-science/PaNET/PaNET00107> rdf:type owl:Class ;
                                               owl:equivalentClass [ rdf:type owl:Restriction ;
                                                                     owl:onProperty <http://purl.org/pan-science/PaNET/PaNET1001000> ;
